ic to the thumb: a case report and review of subungual metastases from all primary sites</article-title><source>Clin Exp Dermatol</source><year>1996</year><volume>21</volume><fpage>377</fpage><lpage>80</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9136162</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b160-co15-5-227e51"><label>160</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Vinod</surname><given-names>SU</given-names></name><name><surname>Gay</surname><given-names>RM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Adenoid cystic carcinoma of the minor salivary glands metastatic to the hand</article-title><source>South Med J</source><year>1979</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>1483</fpage><lpage>5</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">228433</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b161-co15-5-227e51"><label>161</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Viswanathan</surname><given-names>PN</given-names></name><name><surname>Rangad</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Roul</surname><given-names>RK</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Metastases to the hand from carcinoma of the lower alveolus</article-title><source>J Hand Surg [Br]</source><year>1996</year><volume>21</volume><fpage>544</fpage><lpage>6</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="b162-co15-5-227e51"><label>162</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Vittali</surname><given-names>HP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Metastatic tumors of the bones of the hand [German, abstract]</article-title><source>Arch Orthop Unfallchir</source><year>1961</year><volume>53</volume><fpage>364</fpage><lpage>70</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14042365</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b163-co15-5-227e51"><label>163</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Warda</surname><given-names>E</given-names></